{
  "$comment": "Where Tracy Business wp7 (block theme wp-tracy-business, Polylang, Contact Form 7) keeps each topic, read off its contract profiles (content-map, inventory, presentation-lock), the theme files whose bytes the lock pins, and pages captured from a 1.1.0 site (tracy-site-tools test fixtures); every entry carries its proof and test/content-where.test.mjs re-reads them. Left out, not provable here: Open Graph, canonical and JSON-LD (no shipped file prints them, no SEO plugin is inventoried; a meta description only the Claude Cowork plugin prints, from 0.18.0), robots.txt, sitemap and blog_public, an analytics place, the Contact Form 7 recipient, and which menu the 1.2.0 and 1.3.0 header renders (its navigation blocks carry no ref).",
